No CORS configuration is present, which could lead to security issues in browser-based applications.

### 7. No Rate Limiting
The application is vulnerable to denial of service attacks due to lack of rate limiting.

## Recommendations

### 1. Implement Security Headers
Add the helmet middleware to set common security headers:

